"<li>– Proficiency to capture business value from quantum-triggered strategies, capabilities, and innovation initiatives.</li>\n"
"<li>– Expertise to secure and protect Intellectual Property (IP) for quantum technologies.</li>\n"
"<li>– Influence of regulations and standards related to the intended use of quantum computing.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
